#chip 16F886

'Regression check for Change1646: an array declared with an explicit size and a
'comma-separated initializer list (Dim arr(5) As Byte = 1,2,3,4,5) must still work
'unchanged - this exercises the same IsArrayDecl-based variable-name extraction
'that Change1646 touched (previously a bare OpenParenPos check), just for the
'genuine array-declaration case rather than a function-call initializer.

Dim arr(5) As Byte = 1,2,3,4,5
Dim total As Byte
total = arr(0) + arr(4)

Do Forever
  PulseOut PortB.5, total ms
  Wait 900 ms
Loop
